  "description": "A filesystem browser for Cockpit  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * cockpit-files: cockpit-files: Arbitrary file ownership and permission modification via symlink race condition (CVE-2026-91203)\n  * cockpit-files: cockpit-files: Arbitrary file ownership change via symlink following in privileged paste (CVE-2026-91202)\n  * cockpit-files: cockpit-files: Local attacker can hijack file ownership via symlink race (CVE-2026-91205)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
